            "text": "Questions before you join",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "subheading_2": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Something else? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Write to us</a> or <a href=\"/pages/book-a-call\">book a call</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which camera do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>Any camera with a manual mode: mirrorless, DSLR or a compact with M on the dial. The lessons show the settings on the three common dial layouts, and a call can check yours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to buy a new lens?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Everything in the course works with the lens the camera came with. Module five says when a second lens is worth it, and which one to look at first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I do it with my phone?",
            "answer": "<p>The light and composition lessons work with any phone. The settings lessons need manual control, so most of the course assumes a camera.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I miss a live review?",
            "answer": "<p>Every call is recorded and added to the course the same day. Send your photos beforehand and Ida reviews them on the recording.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do I keep the lessons?",
            "answer": "<p>For as long as the course exists. Lessons, recordings and the settings cards stay in your account, and updates are free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pay in parts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. At checkout choose three monthly payments instead of one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Email us within 30 days of joining and you get a full refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
